2026-11-06T02:57:03.0419162Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0420052Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0421077Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0421787Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0422671Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0423648Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0425382Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0426095Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0429938Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0430682Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0431207Z 
2026-11-06T02:57:03.0432233Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
